'' Overloads that differ only in how one type is SPELLED -- 'Box( of tdl )' beside 'Box( of
'' long )', 'unsigned tdl' beside 'ulong', with 'type tdl as long' -- are duplicates, fbc's
'' error 4. They reached clang as TKO0113, "invalid redefinition" (audit F-69).
